#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.1.rst:4
msgid "v4.4.1"
msgstr "v4.4.1"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.4.1 is a small release: QSPI flash on the OpenMV Cam H7 Pro and a camera "
"DCMI pin de-init fix. It introduces **no breaking API changes** — v4.4.0 "
"scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v4.4.1 is een kleine release: QSPI-flashgeheugen op de OpenMV Cam H7 Pro en "
"een fix voor camera DCMI-pin-de-init. Het introduceert **geen breaking API-"
"wijzigingen** — v4.4.0-scripts draaien ongewijzigd."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.1.rst:13
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Op deze pagina"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.1.rst:16
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Hoogtepunten"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.1.rst:18
msgid "**OpenMV Cam H7 Pro** — QSPI flash enabled (more on-board storage)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Cam H7 Pro** — QSPI-flashgeheugen ingeschakeld (meer opslag aan "
"boord)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.1.rst:19
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v4.4.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Geen breaking API-wijzigingen** — flash opnieuw en je v4.4.0-scripts "
"draaien ongewijzigd."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.1.rst:23
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Bugfixes"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.1.rst:25
msgid ""
"Fixed STM32 camera DCMI pin de-initialization, improving sensor re-init/de-"
"init reliability."
msgstr ""
"STM32 camera DCMI-pin-de-initialisatie gecorrigeerd, wat de betrouwbaarheid "
"van sensor-re-init/-de-init verbetert."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.1.rst:29
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hardware- en bordondersteuning"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.1.rst:31
msgid "**OpenMV Cam H7 Pro** — QSPI flash enabled."
msgstr "**OpenMV Cam H7 Pro** — QSPI-flashgeheugen ingeschakeld."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.1.rst:34
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Breaking API-wijzigingen"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.1.rst:36
msgid ""
"v4.4.1 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v4.4.0 run unchanged on v4.4.1 — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v4.4.1 introduceert **geen breaking Python API-wijzigingen**\\ . Scripts die"
" op v4.4.0 draaiden, draaien ongewijzigd op v4.4.1 — flash gewoon de "
"firmware opnieuw."
